            ?observation a tern:Observation ;
                sosa:observedProperty 
        <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/nrm/aeca4fcd-5b42-4e23-9880-9013d6976fb3> ;
                sosa:hasResult ?this .
        }"""
        ] ;
